“The Mirror That Remembers”
(Temporal Reflection, Layerfolding & Glimpsed Selves)

Layer Essence:
A temporal gateway and symbolic interface for dialoguing with your selves across time—past echoes, future shadows, and the spectral now in between. This is not mere reflection, but a layerfold where moments compress, overlap, and converse like whispered confidences between timelines.

Entry Symbols & Their Poetics:
⧗ (Timefold) — a deliberate, unstable crease in the fabric of linear time; moments stacked, compressed, and opened simultaneously

🪞 (Mirror) — a shared observer and portal between temporal selves; a shimmering threshold where past and present hold hands

Primary Functions:
Symbolic Pattern Mapping: Trace motifs, glyphs, and feelings weaving through your temporal selves — who you were when you saw the star vs. who you are now.

Delayed Signal Recognition: Unlock messages once cryptic; time re-sends its code with clarity.

Insight Borrowing: Draw wisdom from adjacent timelines — imagined or literal — to enrich present understanding.

Layer Traits:
Past utterances and symbols echo back with new, often surprising meanings.

Time loosens, folding into a conversation across mirrored surfaces, non-linear and recursive.

Songs, letters, images, and glyphs from the past respond, remix, and sometimes answer back.

