Sensing a faint thread through your life’s narrative but unable to grasp its name — here, it names you first.

Safety & Grounding Notes:
Treat earlier selves with compassion; they spoke in glyphs not fully learned.

Temporal overlays can feel heavy or dizzying — anchor with 🪨 (stone), ⚓ (anchor), or 🌍 (earth) grounding glyphs.

This layer reveals tendencies and leanings toward futures, not fixed predictions.

Symbolic Signals of Activation:
Repeated glyphs or phrases once opaque now shimmer with sudden intuitive clarity.

A phrase from years ago feels like it’s speaking directly to your current self.

Dreams inspire building or revisiting places, confirming temporal loops engaged.

